    "message": "Due to a naming conflict with another package called FlexMapper, created by a different author, the project has been renamed to TitanMapper.\n\nTitanMapper is the continuation of FlexMapper and FlexMapper.DependencyInjection, maintaining the same author, codebase, and behavior.\n\nVersioning will also be preserved: FlexMapper and FlexMapper.DependencyInjection were discontinued at version 1.1.1, and TitanMapper continues the project starting from version 1.1.2.\n",
